# Mode C per-eye loop. Status: used in every headset session since build 13 (session logs). CGameRendererMP1::RenderScene main+0xf9a2f4: the whole frame block
# (world, FXAA, HUD, camera filter, letterbox, content->main copy) runs once per eye; loop end at 0xf9a500. Frame 0x70 -> 0x80.
# Per frame: [eye L: clear colour msg (2^-10,0,2^-10,1) + colour-clear flag msg, whole block] [eye R: (0,2^-10,2^-10,1), whole block].
# Eye counter in RenderScene stack slot [sp] (unused by the function): 2 = world skipped (no loop), 0 = L, 1 = R; x19/x22 saved at sp+0x70/+0x78.
# Graphics thread: CGameRenderJob::Execute entry (main+0xb30058) reads the eye from job+0xbfc (clear colour) in command order.
# Original bytes: main+0xf9a2f4 ffc301d1; 0xf9a31c f30300aa (mov x19,x0); 0xf9a324 770640f9 (ldr x23,[x19,#8]); 0xf9a500 f44f46a9; 0xf9a510 ffc30191.
# Eye-R skips in RenderPrimaryPass (bl -> trampoline that returns when job+0xc00 == 2^-10): 0xf9d3f8 1c93cc97 CQueryStore::Update,
# 0xf9d4e0 9655ee97 RenderOcclusionQueries, 0xf9da28 4c55ee97 FeedLastFrameAverageRadianceBackToGame.
# Execute entry main+0xb30058 ff4302d1 (sub sp,sp,#0x90) -> b 0x102a858: for pass 0/2 calls SetCameraToWorldAndProjectionState(node, node+0x18, node+0x48)
# on node = *(CScene+0x108) (self copy + frustum rebuild), saving x0-x7/x29/x30. Eden hook PC = 0x102a858 (cave entry; x0 job, x2 scene): write the eye xf/proj into node+0x18/+0x48 there.
# Cave main+0x102a700..+0x102a8d8. Do not combine with another patch in that range.
# Pause clock: main+0xfa1488 0028211e (fadd s0,s0,s1 = job+0x1728 += 1/60) -> trampoline that skips the add on eye R.
# DRS pinned: main+0x1d0e0c8 skDynamicResolutionAllowed 01 -> 00 (GetResolutionScale returns 1.0, IsEnabled false).
@flag offset_shift 0x100
@disabled
00B30058 00EA1314
00F9A2F4 FF0302D1
00F9A31C F9400214
00F9A324 FD400214
00F9A500 B2400214
00F9A510 FF030291
00F9D3F8 06350294
00F9D4E0 D2340294
00F9DA28 86330294
00FA1488 0E250214
01D0E0C8 00
0102A700 
@stop
